WEBVTT

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:10.540
So that fool has obtained 
a Giant War Armor.

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:13.870
Owari's movements alone 
are cause for concern,

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:14.840
but more significantly...

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:18.730
This may be a good opportunity to 
test the mettle of Oda's fool-brat,

00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:20.850
whom I've heard so much about in rumors.

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:27.860
I'll give him a taste of my own 
Giant War Armor, Fuurin Kazan!

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.320
Men, to arms!

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:11.710
That is all of the information 
brought to us by Leonardo da Vinci.

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:16.030
So the West is a hair's breadth 
away from attaining unity.

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:18.800
King Arthur... what an uncanny man.

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:20.290
Nobuhide-sama!

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:24.540
Is it not more important to reprimand 
Nobunaga-sama for his reckless actions?

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:28.730
How dare that fool bring barbarians 
from the West into our castle?!

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:33.080
And he did so during Nobukatsu-sama's 
coming of age ceremony!

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:36.320
Nobuhide-sama, if I may make a suggestion...

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:41.260
Why not welcome Sir da Vinci as a 
military tactician in service to the Oda clan?

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:45.960
I believe acquiring his Western 
knowledge and technical expertise

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:48.760
to be urgently necessary for 
the Oda clan's advancement.

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:51.480
It is an undeniable truth 
that our Owari lags

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:53.960
behind Takeda and the other clans.

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:56.770
It is of paramount importance 
that we change this status quo

00:02:56.770 --> 00:02:58.500
by bringing in a breath of fresh air!

00:02:59.350 --> 00:03:01.680
Nobuhide-sama, please make a decision!

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:11.540
Ow...

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:17.960
Why do I have to do this...

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:23.930
I guess no one can see that I'm a woman now?

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:28.140
Man, just look at that!  
You can see so well!

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:35.010
Not a single cloud in that blue sky.

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:37.660
Now that's what you call 
great shooting weather.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:38.800
Nobunaga!

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:46.610
Oh! You don't look half-bad 
like that, Jeanne.

00:03:46.610 --> 00:03:47.910
I mean, Ranmaru.

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:52.080
Weren't you supposed to be at 
the big war council today?

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.340
Oh, that.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:55.910
I can't be bothered, so Mitsu's handling it.

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:56.800
Huh?

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:58.920
Can't be bothered?

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:01.570
A war council full of old 
geezers isn't my kind of thing.

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:05.710
My time is better spent 
looking up at the sun.

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:07.270
I give up.

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:09.580
I can already tell how it'll end, anyway.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.850
If we are hasty, we will fail.

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:15.720
I believe it is too soon 
for us to incorporate

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:18.860
any teachings from the 
strange Star of the West.

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:21.810
When Takeda's forces may 
attack us any moment,

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:24.660
such reticence will surely 
lead the Oda to destruction.

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:27.060
Mitsuhide! Know your place!

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:31.190
It is unacceptably foolish to seek 
aid from Western barbarians.

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:34.870
They could easily be
 spies sent by the Takeda.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.520
If that is the case, 
I shall take responsibility.

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:38.830
Responsibility?!

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:40.180
Who do you think you are?!

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:44.430
Nobuhide-sama, there is no need 
to listen to such drivel.

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:48.020
Who knows what disaster the 
foreigners may bring?

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:50.020
There is no need for rapid reform.

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:53.060
Nobukatsu-sama's personal growth as an 
adult shall bring a new age to the Oda.

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:05.380
It was all for naught, just as I'd feared.

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:30.340
Aren't you the eldest son of the clan lord?

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.790
Then you should at least act more like it—

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:41.770
He's your father, isn't he?

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:46.490
No. He's Clan Lord first, then a father.

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:49.780
Speaking of fathers (chichi),

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:51.410
you hid them well.

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:54.780
Your big breasts (chichi), that is.

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:03.130
Let us embark on our journey, 
my Ameno Torifune.

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:06.180
How I have longed for this 
moment, for so many years...

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:10.550
Fool-dono, I wonder how much 
of a man you've become.

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:15.700
What's the matter?

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:17.330
Nothing...

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:19.890
How did the war council go?

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:23.750
Sorry, Mitsu.

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:26.210
I made you draw the short straw.

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:29.690
Don't be. Going into a losing 
battle does not suit you, Nobu.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:32.480
That's music to my ears.

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:34.180
Well, guess I'll suit myself

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:36.850
and go pay tribute to the 
symbol of the new era.

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:38.230
Hang on!

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:43.020
You're going to make Mitsuhide 
handle all of the annoyances

00:06:43.020 --> 00:06:45.140
while you go admire the War Armor?

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.250
You're like a child, 
who's only interested in his toys.

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:50.080
Ranmaru-dono, that's...

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:51.210
It's fine, Mitsu.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:55.860
The world's too big for me to be 
darting my eyes around all over the place.

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:56.810
What?

00:06:56.810 --> 00:07:00.490
How can I gain dominion if I 
cannot finish even a single task?

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:02.750
Pardon.

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:13.040
I had not expected to find anyone 
other than Mitsuhide and Hideyoshi

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:15.060
who could speak to my brother in such a way.

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:17.430
I am slightly envious.

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:20.140
Wow!

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:22.570
In the end, it is just a prepared target.

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:30.050
I cannot shoot those birds.

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:34.550
I probably lack the resolve necessary to 
shoulder the burden of taking a life.

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:37.020
The burden of... life?

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:39.100
My brother is different.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:41.110
He has the resolve to shoulder

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:42.760
any burden and yet keep 
moving forward.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.960
You smell of flowers.

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:48.060
What?

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:50.510
Ranmaru-dono, was it?

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:53.650
I have a favor to ask of you, man to man.

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:55.900
M-Man to man?

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:59.330
My brother is easily misunderstood.

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:01.020
But you will be certain to see

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:03.410
the true extent of his considerable 
integrity should you stay by his side.

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:04.880
Integrity...

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:09.560
So, until then...

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:11.720
please take care of my brother.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:13.200
Wait, what?

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:14.720
Please, no!

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:16.770
Um...

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:19.020
If you insist!

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:21.130
I will, so please raise your head!

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:24.660
I pray you do not forget those words.

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:43.120
Mitsuhide-sama!

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:46.230
Is something bothering you?

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:48.190
The thickness of its chest plate

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:50.030
is much less than any of 
its other armored parts.

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:52.960
If it has any weak 
spots, that would be it.

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:54.840
You have a keen eye.

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:56.700
Having a Regalia infuse this Armor

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:59.630
is a must in order to 
account for that weakness.

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:00.970
Regalia?

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:04.990
What is it, Mitsu?

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:06.010
Movement has been sighted.

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:06.810
Takeda's coming!

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:08.280
Shingen's coming?

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:12.010
An invitation to a banquet...

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:15.070
<i>All platoons, begin orchestration 
chamber entry procedures.</i>

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.720
<i>Proceed to seal Armor Shells.</i>

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:17.900
<i>All engines online.</i>

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:19.820
<i>Orchestration system 
circuits connected.</i>

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:21.210
<i>Armor controls online.</i>

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:22.680
<i>1st War Armor Platoon, forward!</i>

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:24.360
<i>Next, 2nd Platoon, forward!</i>

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:27.860
<i>Cannon Support Units, maintain 
distance from main troop divisions.</i>

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:27.860
<i>3rd War Armor Platoon, 
deploy to the left and fan out.</i>

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:27.860
<i>7th Squadron, guard the rear!</i>

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:30.720
Your War Armor is still in maintenance.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:31.790
It will not be operable for some time yet.

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:33.400
Then I'll just go as is.

00:09:38.780 --> 00:09:40.140
May fortune be with you.

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.390
Takeda's forces have launched an attack?

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:45.690
Ah, what calamity has befallen us.

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:48.150
It is all because we allowed 
those barbarians to enter...

00:09:48.550 --> 00:09:51.510
Now is not the time for such talk.

00:09:51.510 --> 00:09:52.440
Nobukatsu-sama.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.870
First, defend the castle!

00:09:54.470 --> 00:09:57.300
The evacuation of women and 
children is our first priority.

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:58.520
Out of the way!

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.380
They are vastly superior.

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:17.490
So this is Takeda's army...

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:19.970
Do not falter!

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:23.090
You cannot seize victory 
if you fear the enemy!

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:24.240
Nobunaga-sama!

00:10:38.460 --> 00:10:40.100
He hit the performer!

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:43.590
Even the Takeda are mere 
mortals under their armor!

00:10:43.590 --> 00:10:45.070
There is no reason to fear them!

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.920
He's shooting the performers 
without any hesitation.

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:07.920
You're pretty observant.

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:09.460
You go through arrows too fast!

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:10.900
Think ahead.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:14.660
Men fight with all their 
might in the present.

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:17.140
This is no place for a woman like you.

00:11:17.140 --> 00:11:18.910
I am not a woman!

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:20.280
That's what you, yourself, said.

00:11:20.630 --> 00:11:22.530
That my name is Ranmaru!

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:25.250
Then treat me as a man on the battlefield.

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:28.680
I like the look on your face.

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:32.970
Then come with me, Ranmaru!

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:34.720
Go, Onikage!

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.410
Jeez!

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:40.860
I will see with my own eyes

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:42.640
what manner of man Oda Nobunaga is...

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:52.640
My destiny...

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:57.410
is to save and lead the Star of the West,
 and all other stars in the universe.

00:11:58.370 --> 00:12:00.700
The awakening of the Dragon of the East...

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:03.320
The maiden who saw the destruction 
of the Star of the West...

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:07.150
They are no matter. I am the world,

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:09.900
and I will bestow a future upon 
this star and its people.

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:12.880
Now, da Vinci,

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:15.360
what is your next card?

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:16.920
What are you doing?!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.550
It is just one man!

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:20.950
That attitude will cut your life short!

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:32.720
Ah, what valor!

00:12:32.720 --> 00:12:36.520
Nobunaga-sama has such talent for warfare!

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:39.490
We cannot let the young 
master do all the work.

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:42.670
The men have regained their morale!

00:12:43.830 --> 00:12:44.960
Watch out!

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:53.270
I see.

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:54.670
This weapon is quite accurate.

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:56.660
Ah, you have a discerning eye.

00:12:56.660 --> 00:12:59.170
But it was your own skill 
that landed those shots.

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:00.420
Nobu-sama!

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.010
I've kept the seat warm for you!

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:06.250
You're late, Monkey!

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:16.590
All right, onward to victory!

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:18.560
Jeanne-chan!

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:24.030
Nobunaga-sama is here!

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:35.310
Victory is ours.

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:37.050
That's our Nobu-sama.

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:43.450
What is this dread?

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:56.870
The Chariot, reversed...

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:59.300
It signifies mindless violence...

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:01.300
Mindless violence?

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:06.540
That's...!

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:10.800
What is that?

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:15.610
Takeda Shingen, Clan Lord of Kai,

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:18.450
is now here in the Fuurin Kazan!

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.510
Fool-brat of Oda,

00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:24.930
show your power to me and mine Armor,

00:14:24.930 --> 00:14:27.160
infused with the Great Spirit of Suwa!

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:36.630
Lord Shingen!

00:14:36.630 --> 00:14:39.610
I'm grateful that the general 
himself has made an appearance!

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:41.580
This may not end well.

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:44.540
Please be careful.

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:47.480
The enemy is equipped with a Regalia.

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:49.180
Regalia, you say?

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:54.120
What is that?!

00:14:57.340 --> 00:14:58.450
Ranmaru-dono!

00:14:58.450 --> 00:14:59.530
Jeanne-chan, where are you going?

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:01.620
Those children are trapped!

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:10.610
Withdrawing your men?
 Do you underestimate me?!

00:15:10.820 --> 00:15:14.870
You think leading an army into battle is 
the only measure of one's strength?

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:15.840
How naïve!

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:16.810
What?

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:21.980
Mark this well, fool-brat!

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:37.130
"In raiding and plundering, be like fire!"

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:44.010
There you are.

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.380
It's okay.

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:48.400
Don't be scared of me.

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:50.050
This place isn't safe.

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:51.090
Hurry...

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:52.560
Out!

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:13.270
Nobu-sama!

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:17.540
So that is the God of War, Takeda Shingen...

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:21.940
and his power given form, the Fuurin Kazan!

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:25.220
Strength is solitude!

00:16:25.220 --> 00:16:27.850
To stand apart where none may follow

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:31.390
is the measure of a man worthy of 
gaining dominion over the lands!

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:32.860
I see.

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:35.620
He is stronger than who I am now!

00:16:35.990 --> 00:16:38.370
Those are the flames of a Regalia!

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:39.200
Hurry!

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:40.260
Faster!

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:42.260
This is the fastest we can go.

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:44.130
Fool-dono...

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:56.670
Something's happening in the skies!

00:16:56.670 --> 00:16:58.260
Nobu! Look to Ranmaru!

00:16:58.260 --> 00:16:58.880
What is it?!

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.390
Mister...

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.810
N-No! No!

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:17.900
Mister with the golden hair!

00:17:18.810 --> 00:17:21.220
C'mon, let's get out of here.

00:17:23.340 --> 00:17:24.280
Go...

00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:25.100
Huh?

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:26.640
Go now!

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:27.900
Run!

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:32.120
No! Mister!

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:35.850
Oh, Lord...

00:17:36.350 --> 00:17:37.090
Let me hear your voice...

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.750
<i>Do not fear the flames.</i>

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:47.180
<i>Do not pray to any god.</i>

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:50.340
<i>The man you seek to follow</i>

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:52.300
<i>is one who would cleave flames asunder</i>

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:54.840
<i>and kick the gods aside!</i>

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:06.600
Turning your back on the enemy!
 Have you abandoned the fight?

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:08.650
Coward!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:10.180
Abandoned?

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:11.790
Surely, you jest.

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:14.350
I have just been biding my time...

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:16.160
until I could grasp my chance at victory!

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:22.720
Your pretensions of solitude

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:25.260
and delusions of grandeur

00:18:25.260 --> 00:18:27.800
have prevented you from noticing 
changes in the heavens.

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:29.010
What?

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:33.680
Rain...

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:36.880
Hmph, all that talk over a few raindrops?

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:38.690
If it were just rain,

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:41.290
I'd have no chance at victory.

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:43.690
But I'm willing to wager

00:18:44.030 --> 00:18:48.690
that the heavens... that the 
times will not abandon me!

00:18:50.680 --> 00:18:52.550
So, come at me.

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:53.930
Come!

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:56.900
Lightning?

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:59.940
This is unmistakably the 
manifestation of a Regalia!

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:02.900
What is going on?

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:06.020
Fool-dono of Oda.

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:10.910
I am Queen Himiko of Yamatai.

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:13.100
I have just shown you

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:16.340
the power of the Regalia that 
is in Yamatai's possession.

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:21.610
If Fool-dono will accept my terms,

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:24.860
I am willing to offer you the 
Regalia this very instant.

00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:26.290
The Regalia?

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:30.420
First, you must succeed in 
activating this Regalia.

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:36.770
Second, an alliance must be forged 
between our families through a bond.

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:38.740
Alliance through a bond?

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:40.940
Ha, that is inevitable!

00:19:41.430 --> 00:19:43.450
I accept those terms!

00:19:43.970 --> 00:19:46.650
Then our alliance has been forged.

00:19:51.430 --> 00:19:54.890
So this is the key... to the Regalia!

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:59.630
Raise the key high to point it at both 
heaven and earth, and so swear the following:

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:02.830
"I swear upon my name as Oda Nobunaga..."

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:05.650
Hear me, heaven and earth!

00:20:05.650 --> 00:20:08.170
I swear upon my name as Oda Nobunaga...

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:11.140
"...that I will take Queen 
Himiko of Yamatai..."

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.110
that I will take Queen Himiko of Yamatai...

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:16.580
"...to be my wife!"

00:20:16.930 --> 00:20:18.600
To be my wif...

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:20.380
What?!

00:20:20.380 --> 00:20:21.920
W-Wife?!

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:23.360
She played us!

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:25.020
This is what she meant by "bond"!

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:33.000
What's this?!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:35.720
Is it the sacred marriage 
they speak of in alchemy,

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:38.220
between King and Queen?!

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:41.670
Nobu-sama.

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:45.670
I welcome you, Regalia.

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:14.140
Let it resound like thunder!

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:24.580
So that is the power of 
the Regalia of the East.

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:26.660
Let's hope both the Takeda and the Oda...

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:31.130
...will be drenched in 
tons of scarlet blood!

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:32.990
Enough to fill an ocean!

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:34.530
Of course!

00:21:37.780 --> 00:21:40.770
Well, let us also alight

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:42.640
on this bewitching land

00:21:42.640 --> 00:21:46.670
where strange Regalia 
and beautiful women await us.

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:58.020
You made my Fuurin Kazan kneel!

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:02.950
You are no simple fool!

00:22:03.310 --> 00:22:05.620
You are truly a Great Fool!

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:06.690
Answer me!

00:22:06.690 --> 00:22:09.460
What lies at the end of the path you seek?

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:12.790
There is no end.

00:22:13.290 --> 00:22:19.070
My path will take me to the 
infinite heavens and earth!

00:22:27.350 --> 00:22:29.950
I cannot hope to fathom...

00:22:30.780 --> 00:22:33.880
his heart... his mind!

00:24:12.150 --> 00:24:15.280
Life in the East 
is really inconvenient.

00:24:15.280 --> 00:24:16.820
Their customs are so strange, too.

00:24:17.380 --> 00:24:19.680
Huh? Their ceremony?

00:24:20.390 --> 00:24:22.130
Next time: The Magician.

00:24:22.620 --> 00:24:24.890
I am... Ranmaru.
